| dev | https://dev.phantomequestrian.com | https://shop.dev.phantomequestrian.com | https://api.dev.phantomequestrian.com | 3010 / 8010 | `/var/www/dev.phantomequestrian.com` |
| prod | https://phantomequestrian.com | https://shop.phantomequestrian.com | https://api.phantomequestrian.com | 3009 / 8009 | `/var/www/phantomequestrian.com` |

Host: `jlee@192.168.3.3`. TLS: shared cert `/etc/letsencrypt/live/underdogunlimited.com/`.

Postgres: system package on `127.0.0.1:5432` (not Docker/Podman). DBs: `rideconnect` (dev), `rideconnect_prod` (prod).

Sibling Node ports on this host: Sound Strategy 3003/3004, PMA 3005/3006, UU 3007/3008, **RideConnect 3009/3010**.

## Non-negotiables

1. Safety & anti-trafficking — no off-platform-only messaging/transactions
2. Identity verification gates booking/hosting/friend invites
3. Species-agnostic data model (`animal` + `species`)
4. Auditable bookings, invites, payments

